{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622180/extras/fba8d622b5e4a7da266d82ee8faf7eda.poster.avif?t=1771937064\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622180/extras/fba8d622b5e4a7da266d82ee8faf7eda.webm?t=1771937064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622180/extras/fba8d622b5e4a7da266d82ee8faf7eda.mp4?t=1771937064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Detective Fantasia: EXCALIMURDER</i> is a Game Boy-inspired nonlinear murder mystery game in which you investigate with complete freedom by walking around, inspecting the world and pointing out inconsistencies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, Excalibur is the murder weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622180/extras/5adb0e724fe0b96a158104fcb0a635b8.poster.avif?t=1771937064\" width=268 height=68 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622180/extras/5adb0e724fe0b96a158104fcb0a635b8.webm?t=1771937064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622180/extras/5adb0e724fe0b96a158104fcb0a635b8.mp4?t=1771937064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bell rings on a new year as the body of an orphan was found slashed near Excalibur. Did someone really pull out the legendary sword to commit this atrocity?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Fantasia, a young man who was sent to report on the crime scene, and collect clues to solve this strange murder... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622180/extras/ec123cc5e01f58b85deee83a5c406f10.poster.avif?t=1771937064\" width=344 height=74 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622180/extras/ec123cc5e01f58b85deee83a5c406f10.webm?t=1771937064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622180/extras/ec123cc5e01f58b85deee83a5c406f10.mp4?t=1771937064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore freely the entirety of the Excalibur Orphanage from the beginning! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam around a colorful top-down pixel art world inspired by the Game Boy aesthetic!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to whoever you want, inspect every nook and cranny! Crucial clues get added to your notebook! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open your notebook to reread any clue you've obtained and... </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...if you spot an inconsistency, select the contradicting clues to get closer to the truth! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've discovered every inconsistencies in the case, be ready to face the mind-blowing truth behind this mystery...</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2622180?t=1771937064","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2622180?t=1771937064","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622180/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771937064","capsule_imagev5":"https